@startuml UC-33 Edit Class Information - Sequence Diagram (icon)
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
title 2.12.2.3 UC-33 Edit Class Information — Sequence Diagram

actor Teacher
boundary ":ClassSettingsPage" as UI
control ":ClassController" as CTL
control ":ClassManagementService" as SVC
boundary ":ClassRepository" as REPO
database DB

autonumber
Teacher ->> UI : Open "Class settings" from the Class Hub of an owned class
activate UI
UI ->> UI : load()
UI ->> CTL : GET /api/classes/{id}
activate CTL
CTL ->> SVC : getDetail(id)
activate SVC
SVC -->> CTL : ClassDetail
deactivate SVC
CTL -->> UI : HTTP 200 + ClassDetail
deactivate CTL
UI -->> Teacher : Show the current class details in an editable form, read-only when the class is INACTIVE

Teacher ->> UI : Change the class name, grade or description and select "Save"
UI ->> UI : submit(event)
UI ->> CTL : PATCH /api/classes/{id}
activate CTL
CTL ->> SVC : updateClass(id, name, subject, grade, description)
activate SVC
SVC ->> REPO : findById(id)
activate REPO
REPO ->> DB : SELECT * FROM classes WHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB -->> REPO : row / none
deactivate DB
REPO -->> SVC : Classroom
deactivate REPO
SVC ->> SVC : accept only an existing class owned by the teacher, still ACTIVE, with a valid name and an assigned grade

alt class does not exist, is not owned by the teacher or is INACTIVE
  SVC -->> CTL : ResourceNotFoundException / ForbiddenOperationException
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 404 / 403
  UI -->> Teacher : Show the read-only or access-denied message (MSG23) and keep the stored details unchanged
else the teacher owns an ACTIVE class and the entered details are valid
  SVC ->> REPO : save(Classroom with the updated class information)
  activate REPO
  REPO ->> DB : UPDATE classes SET class information fields, updated_at = ? WHERE id = ?
  activate DB
  DB -->> REPO : Saved
  deactivate DB
  REPO -->> SVC : Classroom
  deactivate REPO
  SVC -->> CTL : ClassDetail
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 200 + ClassDetail
  UI -->> Teacher : Show MSG08 and the updated class information
end
deactivate SVC
deactivate CTL
deactivate UI
@enduml
